# Explicit Mask input for the full analog + standard-cell device set.
# Unlike run_mask_stdcell.lvs (CMOS/diode only), this path recognizes the
# complete implant-derived device palette: PMOS/NMOS/ESD MOS, DP/DN, RR/RS
# resistors, CSIO capacitor, and their backgate contacts.
$tr10_mask_analog = true
